Infer a subscripted subclass of a subscripted ``typing`` alias, such as
``Z[str]`` for ``class Z(typing.IO[AnyStr])``, as the class instead of an
instance of it. A metaclass method reached through a class now binds the class
even when the metaclass node was rebuilt by a brain or the method comes from a
base metaclass.

Refs #3371
Closes pylint-dev/pylint#10042
